# Lighthouse Handoff — .gitignore
# Public repo for the Chrome extension that turns PageSpeed Insights into agent-ready Markdown reports.

# --- OS / System ---
.DS_Store
Thumbs.db
Desktop.ini

# --- Editor / IDE ---
.vscode/
.idea/
*.swp
*.swo
*~

# --- Logs & temp ---
*.log
npm-debug.log*
*.tmp
tmp/
debug/
*.bak

# --- Dependencies / Generated (NEVER commit built packages) ---
node_modules/
dist/
build/
*.crx
*.xpi
lighthouse-handoff*.zip
pagespeed-report-*.md

# --- Environment / Secrets (critical) ---
.env
.env.*
*.pem
*.key
*.crt

# --- Chrome / Extension specific ---
# (dist/ already covers the packaged output from pack-extension.ps1)

# --- Web store submission working files (optional: commit real screenshots when ready) ---
# Keep placeholder images, but you may want to .gitignore real high-res personal captures if they contain private URLs
# webstore-assets/real-*.png
# webstore-assets/real-*.jpg

# --- Misc project ---
# Keep planning docs (IMPLEMENTATION-PLAN.md, TASKS.md, project-details.md) for history/context
# They are useful for contributors and the project record.
